            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press Play below to start the backing. On each chord, strike the triad on beat 1, then pick three of its notes, one per beat, until the chord and its notes run on without a gap.\nThen try the other variant. Use the Variant selector below to change the key, then press Play to start the backing again.\nWhen you change the variant, the chords are new, but each triad sits in the same place inside the position."
          },
